    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Subsection (2) of Section 7 of the Bank of Ceylon Ordinance (Chapter 397), I,Mangala Samaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this Order determine that the paid-up capital of theBank of Ceylon shall be increased from rupees Fifteen Billion to rupees Twenty Billion.",
